.TH ALIENS-INVADERS 6 "10-SEP-2026" "@VERSION@" "Aliens Invaders Manual"
.SH NAME
aliens-invaders \- Modern arcade vertical space shooter powered by C++20 and SDL3
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B aliens-invaders
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B Aliens Invaders
is an arcade vertical-scrolling space combat game engineered natively for
.B Wayland
and modern platforms using
.BR SDL3 " and " C++20 .
.PP
The engine incorporates GPU-accelerated double buffering, tear-free frame pacing, lock-free procedural sound synthesis, compile-time embedded assets, tactical nuke weapons, and resolution-segregated leaderboards.
.SH CONTROLS
.TP
.BI Space
Fire plasma cannons.
.TP
.BI Left\ / \ Right\ Arrow
Move vessel horizontally.
.TP
.BI t
Toggle Ship Model (Cruiser vs Vanguard).
.TP
.BI f
Toggle Fullscreen mode (native monitor resolution up to 4K UHD).
.TP
.BI 1,\ 2,\ 3
Preset window sizes: 1280x720, 1600x900, 1920x1080.
.TP
.BI -\ / \ +
Adjust Particle Density (0 OFF to 4 MAX).
.TP
.BI h
Cycle Hall of Fame displays (Per-Resolution, Global Legends, and Help).
.TP
.BI p
Pause / Resume active game.
.TP
.BI s
Start a new game (from menu).
.TP
.BI q
Quit current match or exit game.
.TP
.BI c
Cheat mode (recovers shield, fire rate, and multi-cannons; disables leaderboard saving).
.SH AUTHORS
.B Claudio Fernandes de Souza Rodrigues
(Engine Architecture, C++20 Native SDL3 Platform, Procedural Audio Synthesis, Aerodynamics & Gameplay).
